{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector","doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/iOSJailbreakDetector"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Detects DYLD injection by checking if a suspicious dynamic library is loadable in the current process.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"library","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeoutSeconds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20iOSJailbreakDetector19DYLDInjectionResultO","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/DYLDInjectionResult","text":"DYLDInjectionResult"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"library","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Name of the dynamic library to check (e.g., ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"MobileSubstrate.dylib\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\"libhooker.dylib\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maximum time (in seconds) to wait for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dlopen"},{"type":"text","text":". Defaults to 0.1s."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"timeoutSeconds"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/DYLDInjectionResult","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" indicating the detection status:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".clean(loadTime:library:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": No injection detected","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".suspicious(delay:library:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Suspicious delay during load attempt (possible hooking)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".injected(handle:loadTime:library:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Confirmed injection - library successfully loaded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enhanced version that measures load time to detect hooking delays, validates the library handle,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and provides detailed detection results for security logging."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Uses ","type":"text"},{"code":"RTLD_NOLOAD","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flag to check if library is already loaded without forcing a new load."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Darwin"},{"type":"text","text":". Modern jailbreaks may hook "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dlopen"},{"text":" to evade detection.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage example:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Check common jailbreak libraries","let libraries = [\"MobileSubstrate.dylib\", \"libhooker.dylib\", \"SSLKillSwitch2.dylib\"]","","for library in libraries {","    let result = checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming(library: library, timeoutSeconds: 0.1)","","    switch result {","    case .clean(let time, _):","        Logger.security.debug(\"Clean: $$library) checked in $$time*1000, specifier: \"%.1f\")ms\")","    case .suspicious(let delay, _):","        Logger.security.warning(\"Suspicious DYLD delay: $$library) took $$delay*1000, specifier: \"%.1f\")ms\")","    case .injected(_, let time, _):","        Logger.security.error(\"DYLD INJECTION DETECTED: $$library) loaded in $$time*1000, specifier: \"%.1f\")ms\")","        return result \/\/ Early exit on confirmed injection","    }","}"]},{"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Part of layered jailbreak detection. Combine with file checks and sandbox tests for comprehensive protection.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/iosjailbreakdetector\/iosjailbreakdetector\/checkdyldinjectionwithtiming(library:timeoutseconds:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"iOSJailbreakDetector"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming(library:timeoutSeconds:)","externalID":"s:20iOSJailbreakDetectorAAC28checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming7library14timeoutSecondsAA0D6ResultOSS_SdtF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"library"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"timeoutSeconds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DYLDInjectionResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:20iOSJailbreakDetector19DYLDInjectionResultO"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming(library:timeoutSeconds:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://iOSJailbreakDetector/documentation/iOSJailbreakDetector/DYLDInjectionResult":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/DYLDInjectionResult","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Detailed result from DYLD injection detection with timing analysis.","type":"text"}],"title":"DYLDInjectionResult","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DYLDInjectionResult"}],"url":"\/documentation\/iosjailbreakdetector\/dyldinjectionresult","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DYLDInjectionResult","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://iOSJailbreakDetector/documentation/iOSJailbreakDetector/iOSJailbreakDetector/checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming(library:timeoutSeconds:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Detects DYLD injection by checking if a suspicious dynamic library is loadable in the current process."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"library","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeoutSeconds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20iOSJailbreakDetector19DYLDInjectionResultO","text":"DYLDInjectionResult"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/checkDYLDInjectionWithTiming(library:timeoutSeconds:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbo